# The per-area API specs are generated by `pnpm docs:openapi` in the studio
# repo, which always writes LF. With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default)
# Git would check them out as CRLF, so every regeneration reported all 14 files
# as modified even when the content was byte-identical — which hides a real
# change among fourteen fake ones. Pin them to LF so a regeneration that
# changed nothing leaves a clean tree.
api-reference/*.json text eol=lf
